{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":483750,"name":"oscar mei","username":"oscar_mei","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/o/3da27b/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-05T02:44:21.577Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEvery message to Grok Bot fails with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBot failed to respond / Something went wrong while generating the reply. Try again.\u003cbr\u003e\n(Chinese UI: “Bot 未能回复 / 生成回复时出错了。请重试。”)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis happens on a simple “你好” / hello as well, not only a computer-use task.\u003cbr\u003e\nThe Agent Computer screen is still visible (linux.do was open), so this is not a local app crash.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSettings → Updates → Reset Grok Bot’s Computer then failed with:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eReset failed. The reset couldn’t finish. Grok Bot’s computer may be in a partial state — retry to run the reset again.\u003cbr\u003e\n(Chinese UI: “重置失败。重置未能完成。Grok Bot 的电脑可能处于不完整状态，请重试以再次运行重置。”)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame class of stuck Agent Computer as \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-failed-to-respond/170235\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok bot failed to respond\u003c/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-reset-failed-computer-stuck-in-partial-state-cant-connect/170430\" class=\"inline-onebox\"\u003eGrok Bot: Reset failed / computer stuck in partial state — can't connect\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/rebuild the Agent Computer on the backend for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot 0.43.0 on macOS (updated from 0.36.0).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a short message such as “你好” to an existing bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eError appears: Bot failed to respond / Something went wrong while generating the reply.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Settings → Updates → Reset Grok Bot’s Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eReset fails with: Reset couldn’t finish. Grok Bot’s computer may be in a partial state.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShort messages should get a reply.\u003cbr\u003e\nReset / Update Agent Computer should complete instead of leaving the cloud computer in a partial state.\u003cbr\u003e\nIf the computer is stuck server-side, please recover it on your end (client reset cannot finish).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot: 0.43.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin (macOS 26.6.2, Apple M5 Pro)\u003cbr\u003e\nApp bundle: com.anysphere.sand\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-for-ai-issues-which-model-did-you-use-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: which model did you use?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot default (not selectable in the Grok Bot app)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-for-ai-issues-add-request-id-with-privacy-disabled-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eFor AI issues: add Request ID with privacy disabled\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConversation ID: 1bc8e946-976f-46b2-9768-694f6d31de6b\u003cbr\u003e\nConversation ID: 8a67f967-6235-48b4-a2d3-710f92305a25\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-additional-information-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-additional-information-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTried (did not fix):\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated desktop app 0.36.0 → 0.43.0\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit and reopen (Cmd+Q)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort hello with no tools/connectors\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSettings → Updates → Reset Grok Bot’s Computer → Reset failed, partial state\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease do not keep retrying Reset from the client; the computer looks stuck server-side.\u003cbr\u003e\nTimezone: Asia/Shanghai (CST). Started 2026-09-05 ~10:26–10:37 CST.\u003cbr\u003e\nForum account used to file this: oscar_mei (same Google account as Grok Bot).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-483750-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-483750-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":3,"updated_at":"2026-09-05T08:06:37.344Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_